id: ki-sealed
name: Ki-Sealed
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: the entry names Fatigued, and this is only what keeps it on.
combatCondition: no
# "A stack of the Fatigued Combat Condition (that cannot be removed while you're wearing this
# Accessory)." One stack held: any more above it come off as they would.
holds: fatigued
holdsStacks: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Ki-Sealing Handcuff is locked on you. A stack of Fatigued cannot come off.
text: >
  Ki-Sealed: the Ki-Sealing Handcuff's mark. "While wearing this Accessory, you suffer from a
  stack of the Fatigued Combat Condition (that cannot be removed while you're wearing this
  Accessory)."

---

# Put on with the handcuff and taken off with it, never by hand: the Key is the only way out.
#
# No effects of its own. What the handcuff forbids is in its own file, and applies while it
# is worn.
